# Delney, Streetwise Lookout: "If a triggered ability of a creature you control with power 2 or less triggers, that ability
# triggers an additional time" (CR 603.2d). Bot1's Baleful Strix (1/1) enters and its draw triggers twice; Bot1's Tersa
# Lightshatter (3/3) enters and its discard-and-draw triggers once (one Island discarded - a second copy would discard two
# more by default); Bot2's Strix, not Bot1's, draws once.
# Bot1: turn 1 Delney (Plains, Mox Pearl, Mox Jet) and Mox Sapphire; turn 3 Mox Ruby, the Strix (Sapphire, Jet) and Tersa
# (Ruby, Plains, Pearl). Hand: 7 - 5 = 2; turn 3 draws the Ruby (3), casts it, the Strix and Tersa (0) and draws two (2),
# then Tersa discards an Island and draws one (2).
# Bot2: turn 2, 8 cards, casts two Moxen and the Strix (5) and draws one (6).

